# Prep Meal documentation

When this theme’s pages, sections, templates, or merchant-facing content workflow change:

1. Update **`G:\kodesolution\htdocs\sanikodesolution\shopify\prepmeal-shopify-doc`** (not a `docs/` folder inside the theme).
2. Keep at least these in sync when relevant:
   - `PAGE-SECTIONS.md` — page → section map
   - `CONTENT-GUIDE.md` — Bangla merchant content guide
   - `PLAN-PRODUCT-CONTENT.md` — meal plan Customize / product content
   - `index.html` — HTML documentation site (templates, sections, changelog)
3. Commit and push **`prepmeal-shopify-doc`** GitHub repo after doc edits.
4. Do **not** put long-form docs inside the theme repo.
